   180→ * 2. Enable Cooperation: Achieve international coordination on climate/AI
   181→ * 3. Recover from Crisis: Accelerate recovery from economic/social crisis
   182→ * 4. Unlock Breakthrough: Trigger research breakthrough under adverse conditions
   183→ *
   184→ * Escape success probability = agencyPotential (calculated above)
   185→ */
   186→export function attemptEscape(
   187→  state: GameState,
